==Battleground==
*1 [[Relic Bun-Bun]] spawns as the boss after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Bun Bun Symbiote]] spawns as the boss after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Bun Bun Black]] spawns as the boss after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Li'l Bun Bun]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Relic Doge]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This may look like a remake of [[No More Bad Dreams]] at first glance, but this stage has an enemy limit of 2, making it a pushover. Use [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can]] for startoff, although be aware that they won't 1-shot the Celeboodle or Relic Doge. For the bosses, [[Master of Logic Newtone (Special Cat)|Master of Logic Mewtone]] works very well, since he targets every Bun Bun variant except Relic. [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]] is also useful, both for extra DPS and for nearly perma-slowing Relic Bun-Bun.

==Trivia==
*[[Mecha-Bun (Enemy)|Mecha-Bun]] and [[Xenobeast Bunaglios]] are the only non-event variants of [[Teacher Bun Bun]] not to appear in Efficient Timewasting.

